    {
      "id": "step-13",
      "label": "Processing for email",
      "operation": "generate",
      "adapter": "model",
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "configuration_input": "step-13-modelid"
        },
        "options": {},
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": {
                "expression": "Please analyze the following data and output the results in tabular form:\n\n| Metrics | Last 7 days | Previous year | Percentage change |\n|-------------------------------|---------------|---------|\n| Total page views | {{ steps[\"step-8\"].record.sum_Aufrufe }} | {{ steps[\"step-9\"].record.sum_Aufrufe }} | Percentage change |\n| total users | {{ steps[\"step-8\"].record.sum_Nutzer }} | {{ steps[\"step-9\"].record.sum_Nutzer }} | Percentage change |\n| Total sessions | {{ steps[\"step-8\"].record.sum_Sitzungen }} | {{ steps[\"step-9\"].record.sum_Sitzungen }} | Percentage change |\n| Average sessions/user | {{ steps[\"step-8\"].record.average_Sitzungen_pro_Nutzer }} | {{ steps[\"step-9\"].record.average_Sitzungen_pro_Nutzer }} | Percentage change |\n| Average session duration | {{ steps[\"step-8\"].record.average_Sitzungsdauer }} | {{ steps[\"step-9\"].record.average_Sitzungsdauer }} | Percentage change |\n| Total purchases | {{ steps[\"step-8\"].record['sum_Käufe'] }} | {{ steps[\"step-9\"].record['sum_Käufe'] }} | Percentage change |\n| Average revenue/purchase | {{ steps[\"step-8\"].record.average_Revenue_pro_Kauf }} | {{ steps[\"step-9\"].record.average_Revenue_pro_Kauf }} | Percentage change |\n| Total revenue | {{ steps[\"step-8\"].record.sum_Revenue }} | {{ steps[\"step-9\"].record.sum_Revenue }} | Percentage change |\n\nFormat for numbers:\n- Dot (.) for numbers in thousands (e.g. 4,000)\n- Comma (,) for decimal numbers (e.g. 3.4)\n- Conversion of average session duration in minutes instead of seconds\n- Average turnover/purchase and total turnover in €\n\nPlease write a short summary of the analyzed data above the table (in a maximum of 3 sentences!)\n\nPlease format to a sleek and modern HTML format so that the result can be sent as HTML mail!\n\nStructure of the e-mail:\n\n“Hello! Here is the Weekly Report: Google Analytics of the last 7 days!\n[Summary]\n[Table]”"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
